></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> OpenGL 3.3-compatible graphics and current proprietary or Mesa drivers required. Target: 1920×1080 at 60 FPS.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 LTS or SteamOS 3, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 or AMD Radeon RX 460<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Current proprietary or Mesa graphics drivers recommended.</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Scattered Discs"], "publishers": ["Scattered Discs"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 20, "initial_formatted": "$9.99", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1299003], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy False Alarm", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1299003, "percent_savings_text": "-20% ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "False Alarm - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99</span> $7.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 799}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 66, "description": "Color Alternatives"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 80, "description": "#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "S